<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4036] Near cache is not expired together with corresponding server cache</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4036</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;br/&gt;
1. Configure server cache with expiry time&lt;br/&gt;
2. Start server node&lt;br/&gt;
3. Configure client node with near cache&lt;br/&gt;
4. Start client node&lt;br/&gt;
5. Put elements to cache&lt;br/&gt;
6. Wait for the expiry of the cache&lt;br/&gt;
7. Check cache state (server/client)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
